{"data":{"allAboutMarkdown":{"sections":[{"frontmatter":{"imageAlt":"PIc","imageSrc":{"childImageSharp":{"gatsbyImageData":{"layout":"constrained","placeholder":{"fallback":"data:image/jpeg;base64,"},"images":{"fallback":{"src":"/static/d907e4addabb36b97baa3029429e192d/c17d9/Sepehr_Zohoori_Rad_Portfolio_pic.jpg","srcSet":"/static/d907e4addabb36b97baa3029429e192d/a7b40/Sepehr_Zohoori_Rad_Portfolio_pic.jpg 100w,\n/static/d907e4addabb36b97baa3029429e192d/07d45/Sepehr_Zohoori_Rad_Portfolio_pic.jpg 200w,\n/static/d907e4addabb36b97baa3029429e192d/c17d9/Sepehr_Zohoori_Rad_Portfolio_pic.jpg 400w,\n/static/d907e4addabb36b97baa3029429e192d/a606a/Sepehr_Zohoori_Rad_Portfolio_pic.jpg 800w","sizes":"(min-width: 400px) 400px, 100vw"},"sources":[{"srcSet":"/static/d907e4addabb36b97baa3029429e192d/ed451/Sepehr_Zohoori_Rad_Portfolio_pic.webp 100w,\n/static/d907e4addabb36b97baa3029429e192d/d1e01/Sepehr_Zohoori_Rad_Portfolio_pic.webp 200w,\n/static/d907e4addabb36b97baa3029429e192d/eb7a8/Sepehr_Zohoori_Rad_Portfolio_pic.webp 400w,\n/static/d907e4addabb36b97baa3029429e192d/b5180/Sepehr_Zohoori_Rad_Portfolio_pic.webp 800w","type":"image/webp","sizes":"(min-width: 400px) 400px, 100vw"}]},"width":400,"height":441}}}},"html":"<p>Hi there! I'm a motivated software developer with a strong interest in technology and finding creative solutions to real-world problems. My expertise spans artificial intelligence, full-stack development, and firmware engineering.</p>\n<p>I discovered my passion for programming in middle school and have been hooked ever since. After graduating from high school, I explored various fields of study, including engineering and psychology, before deciding to pursue my true calling by enrolling in BCIT's Computer Systems Technology diploma program with a focus on artificial intelligence and machine learning.</p>\n<p>I am currently in my final year of the program and anticipate graduation in December 2023. When I'm not coding, I enjoy playing music, staying active, and working on personal projects.</p>"}]}}}